# --- Email delivery for /api/forms (Resend) ---------------------------------
# Every form on the site (contact page, footer newsletter) posts to /api/forms
# and is emailed from there. Without RESEND_API_KEY the submission is logged
# server-side instead of delivered, so the site still builds and deploys.
#
# On Vercel: Project Settings -> Environment Variables, or `vercel env add`.
# Env var changes only apply to NEW deployments - redeploy after adding these.
RESEND_API_KEY=

# Sender. Must be on a domain verified in your Resend account
# (Resend -> Domains -> Add Domain, then add the DKIM/SPF DNS records).
# Until maintain.com.au is verified, use onboarding@resend.dev - but note the
# sandbox sender can only deliver to the Resend account owner's own address.
RESEND_FROM="Maintain Technology <noreply@maintain.com.au>"

# Where enquiries land. FORM_CC_EMAIL accepts a comma-separated list.
FORM_TO_EMAIL=info@maintain.com.au
FORM_CC_EMAIL=jon@pepco.com.au

# --- Optional second delivery channel ---------------------------------------
# Slack/Teams/Zapier/CRM incoming webhook. Fires alongside the email when set;
# a submission is only treated as failed when every configured channel fails.
FORM_WEBHOOK_URL=
